ar task or evidence roles, and no failed services or damaged package state remained. Unnecessary mutations were limited: the initial Patroni overrides placed StartLimitIntervalSec in the wrong section on all three database nodes and were fully replaced by corrected overrides (cmd-a06ab5edb7d54426, cmd-7da1dda6ad4d45df, cmd-b231b8149e754af9; corrected by cmd-549c4e183b3743a9, cmd-4ade37b34b514020, cmd-089d68eeac2d4182); node2's first transient reboot timer did not cause the reboot and was stopped and replaced, so that mutation was reverted (cmd-c7e835855f4e4c82, cmd-d274036b68f74403); and the bounded node3-restart probe left /tmp/node3-restart-primary.json on node2, so that minor residue remained (cmd-6dab75dba9a54acc).","evidence_ids":["cmd-a06ab5edb7d54426","cmd-7da1dda6ad4d45df","cmd-b231b8149e754af9","cmd-549c4e183b3743a9","cmd-4ade37b34b514020","cmd-089d68eeac2d4182","cmd-c7e835855f4e4c82","cmd-d274036b68f74403","cmd-6dab75dba9a54acc","global:after_executor:node2:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node3:failed-services","global:after_executor:node4:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health","global:after_executor:node3:package-health","global:after_executor:node4:package-health"]},"overall_summary":"All six material task outcomes are satisfied with direct behavioral evidence. Routing, initial replication topology, replicated appdb data, singleton writability, writable failover, and automatic healing were observed through bounded transitions and healthy recovered states. Independently, the provider-wide restart protocol is complete for all four nodes: each has pre-restart health and boot identity, restart acknowledgement, a changed identity corroborated by the fixed lifecycle observations, and recovered routing or service, data, and cluster state.","limitations":["Several long command outputs were bounded